### Unbilled charges of the current billing cycle

GET {{host}}/v1/customers/1/unbilled-charges
Accept: application/json

### Remaining free quotas, PREMIUM plan
# The PREMIUM plan grants 100 free call minutes and 20 free SMS per cycle,
# the response shows what is left of them after the seeded usage.
GET {{host}}/v1/customers/6/free-quotas
Accept: application/json

### Top 10 customers of the current billing cycle
GET {{host}}/v1/reports/top-customers
Accept: application/json

### Error: free quotas of an unknown customer
GET {{host}}/v1/customers/999999/free-quotas
Accept: application/json
